{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# $[4,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$: can clean combinations of localized insertions fix every CG state?\n\nFollow-up to `Minimal-ingredients-310-EH.wb` (Section 8) and `Blindspot-420-check-EH.wb`. Self-contained; the first code cell clears the (shared) kernel. Precision `pr`; 729-dimensional sparse matrices.\n\n**Insertions** (`L2-420-localization.md`), seven in all:\n- site 1 at $\\theta_1-4h$: $T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,2)},T_{(3,2)},T_{(4,2)}$;\n- site 2: $t_2(\\theta_2+h)$, $T_{(2,2)}(\\theta_2)$, $T_{(2,2)}(\\theta_2)\\,t_1(\\theta_2-2h)$;\n- plus the bare row $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$.\n\n**Bare-frame bookkeeping.** For $W_X=\\langle\\Omega|X$, the frame with $R$ undone is never needed, because $(R\\otimes R)^{\\pm1}$ fixes HW vectors and $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle=e_1e_1\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$:\n$$S_X=W_X\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi,\\qquad K_X=W_X\\cdot\\Psi_\\perp-(W_X\\cdot e_1e_1)\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle .$$\nThese are the signal and the top-killed contamination of insertion $X$, exactly as in the $[3,1,0]$ notebook. The site-1 normalizations $f_\\lambda$ only rescale the basis, so they are dropped.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nΛ = {4, 2, 0}; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^2; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1]; pr = 120;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5};\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEN[i_, j_] := EN[i, j] = N[DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd], pr];\nEtot[i_, j_] := Etot[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[EN[i, j]], SparseArray[id1]] + KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[id1], SparseArray[EN[i, j]]];\nwt1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[a + b, {a, wt1}, {b, wt1}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1]; e11 = kron[e1, e1];\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 8}];\nmaxAbs[m_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[{Normal[m]}]]];\n(* transfer matrices: sparse two-site t_a(x) with twist diag(zv), memoized; one-site for locality checks *)\nlax1[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN EN[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntwistR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nlax2[x_] := lax2[x] = With[{L1 = lax1[1, x], L2 = lax1[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[L1[[i, k]]], SparseArray[L2[[k, j]]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\ntq[mono_, a_, x_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono[x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntL2[a_, x_, zv_] := tL2[a, x, zv] = tq[twistR[lax2[#], DiagonalMatrix[zv]] &, a, x];\nnu[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, 2}];\n(* covector chains: <c| t_a(x), and <c| T_λ(x) via the CBR permutation sum (t_3 = quantum determinant) *)\ntApply[cv_, a_, x_, zv_] := Which[a == 0, cv, a == 3, (Times @@ zv) nu[1][x] nu[2][x - hN] nu[3][x - 2 hN] cv, True, cv . tL2[a, x, zv]];\nconj[λ_] := Table[Count[λ, y_ /; y >= j], {j, Max[λ]}];\ncovT[λ_, x_, zv_, c0_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0 c0, Signature[σ] Fold[tApply[#1, #2[[1]], #2[[2]], zv] &, c0, Table[{as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN}, {i, n}]]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\n(* Ω and x0 (factorized inverse of P_phys: stable at small ε) *)\nrOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nOm1[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, e1 . nexp[r[[1]] EN[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] EN[2, 3]]];\nOm2[zv_, wv_] := With[{o = Om1[zv, wv]}, kron[o, o]];\nrsSol[zv_] := {s1 -> zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), s2 -> -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), s3 -> 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]]), ρ1 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), ρ2 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), ρ3 -> (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nx0One[zv_] := With[{q = rsSol[zv]}, e1 . nexp[-((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[2, 3]] . nexp[(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[1, 3]] . nexp[-(1/zv[[1]]) EN[1, 2]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[({s1, s2, s3}[[k]] /. q)^(-J0[k][p]), {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexp[-(ρ3 /. q) EN[2, 1]] . nexp[-(ρ2 /. q) EN[3, 1]] . nexp[-(ρ1 /. q) EN[3, 2]]];\nx0[zv_] := With[{x = x0One[zv]}, kron[x, x]];\n(* the seven insertions as covectors W_X = <Ω|X *)\ninsLabels = {\"T11(θ1-4h)\", \"T22(θ1-4h)\", \"T32(θ1-4h)\", \"T42(θ1-4h)\", \"t2(θ2+h)\", \"T22(θ2)\", \"T22(θ2)t1(θ2-2h)\"};\nWcovs[zv_, wv_] := Module[{o = Om2[zv, wv], u1 = thN[[1]] - 4 hN, u2 = thN[[2]], T22b},\n   T22b = covT[{2, 2}, u2, zv, o];\n   Join[Table[covT[λ, u1, zv, o], {λ, {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}, {4, 2}}}], {o . tL2[2, u2 + hN, zv], T22b, T22b . tL2[1, u2 - 2 hN, zv]}]];\n(* locality: site-1 = rows ∝ Ω_zw, site-2 = columns ∝ Ω_zw (relative residuals) *)\nlocRes[cv_, o_, s_] := With[{C = Partition[cv, d1]}, If[s == 1, Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, C . o/(o . o), o]]], Norm[Flatten[C - Outer[Times, o, o . C/(o . o)]]]]/Norm[Flatten[C]]];\nzT = N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]; wT = N[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, pr];\n{tW, locT} = AbsoluteTiming[With[{W = Wcovs[zT, wT], o = Om1[zT, wT]}, Table[N[locRes[W[[j]], o, If[j <= 4, 1, 2]], 3], {j, 7}]]];\nGrid[{{\"Λ, two-site dim\", {Λ, d2}}, {\"locality residuals of the 7 insertions (finite twist)\", locT}, {\"time for one W-family (s)\", tW}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"68\" data-out-n=\"749\" data-sub-idx=\"45\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"55\" data-sub-end=\"55\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[749]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ, two-site dim</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locality residuals of the 7 insertions (finite twist)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">time for one W-family (s)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">729</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.178555</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
