       "data": "Out[749]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{$\\Lambda$, two-site dim} & \\left\\{\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\},729\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{locality residuals of the 7 insertions (finite twist)} & \\left\\{0,0,0,0,0,0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{time for one W-family (s)} & 1.178555\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
