  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. HW-limit states and how deep the contamination goes\nAs in the $[3,1,0]$ notebook: per HW weight sector, eigenvectors of $t_1+\\pi t_2$ at $u=3/7$, normalized $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$, with HW-limit states selected by $\\|P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi\\|/\\|\\Psi\\|>0.9$. For each non-top HW state and each insertion $X$, the table gives the $\\varepsilon$-powers $p_S$ of the signal $S_X$ and $p_K$ of the top-killed contamination $K_X$, from $\\varepsilon=10^{-3},10^{-4}$, with \"-\" for an exact zero. $p_S-p_K>0$ means the contamination dominates by that many orders: a clean combination must cancel it through $p_S-p_K$ subleading orders, not just at leading order.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "φ = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; ω = {3/4, -1/5, 2/9};\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, With[{ns = NullSpace[Normal[Join[Etot[1, 2][[All, sec]], Etot[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]]}, If[ns === {}, {}, Orthogonalize[Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d2}]], {n, ns}]]]]];\nprojHW[μ_, v_] := If[hwB[μ] === {}, 0 v, (hwB[μ] . v) . hwB[μ]];\nhwSecs = Select[Reverse[Sort[Select[Union[wtBasis], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] &]]], Length[hwB[#]] > 0 &];\nhwList = Flatten[Table[{μ, k}, {μ, hwSecs}, {k, Length[hwB[μ]]}], 1];\nstatesAt[zv_] := statesAt[zv] = Module[{mix = tL2[1, 3/7, zv] + N[Pi, pr] tL2[2, 3/7, zv], x = x0[zv]},\n   Flatten[Table[With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[Normal[mix[[sec, sec]]]]}, Table[With[{ψ = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]}, With[{Ψ = ψ/(x . ψ)},\n          <|\"mu\" -> μ, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"psi\" -> Ψ, \"hwFrac\" -> Norm[projHW[μ, Ψ]]/Norm[Ψ]|>]], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {μ, Rest[hwSecs]}], 1]];\npickState[μ_, copy_, zv_] := SortBy[Select[statesAt[zv], #[\"mu\"] === μ && #[\"hwFrac\"] > 9/10 &], Re[#[\"ev\"]] &][[copy]];\n(* signal and top-killed contamination of every insertion for one state, at (zv, wv) *)\nSK[Ψ_, μ_, W_, zv_, wv_] := With[{hw = projHW[μ, Ψ]}, With[{perp = Ψ - hw, om = Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ}, {Table[w . hw, {w, W}], Table[w . perp - (w . e11) om, {w, W}]}]];\nnonTop = Rest[hwList];\npowOf[a_, b_, e1_, e2_] := If[Abs[a] == 0 || Abs[b] == 0, \"-\", Round[Log[Abs[b]/Abs[a]]/Log[e2/e1], 0.01]];\n{tD, depth} = AbsoluteTiming[Module[{εa = 10^-3, εb = 10^-4, za, zb, wa, wb, Wa, Wb},\n    za = N[Exp[εa φ], pr]; zb = N[Exp[εb φ], pr]; wa = N[Exp[εa ω], pr]; wb = N[Exp[εb ω], pr]; Wa = Wcovs[za, wa]; Wb = Wcovs[zb, wb];\n    Table[With[{Ψa = pickState[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], za][\"psi\"], Ψb = pickState[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], zb][\"psi\"]}, With[{A = SK[Ψa, μc[[1]], Wa, za, wa], B = SK[Ψb, μc[[1]], Wb, zb, wb]},\n        {μc[[1]], μc[[2]], powOf[Norm[Ψa], Norm[Ψb], εa, εb], Table[powOf[A[[1, j]], B[[1, j]], εa, εb], {j, 7}], Table[powOf[A[[2, j]], B[[2, j]], εa, εb], {j, 7}]}]], {μc, nonTop}]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"p(‖Ψ‖)\", \"p_S per insertion \" <> ToString[Range[7]], \"p_K per insertion\"}}, depth, {{\"insertions\", Row[insLabels, \", \"], \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", tD, \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
