   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of Section 1.** For every HW state the signal and the top-killed contamination of each insertion have the same $\\varepsilon$-power ($p_S-p_K=0$), or the contamination is subleading ($-1$), or the signal vanishes exactly. This includes $[5,4,3]$ ($\\|\\Psi\\|\\sim\\varepsilon^{-10}$) and $[4,4,4]$ ($\\varepsilon^{-12}$). The $\\varepsilon^{3,4}$ suppression of their overlaps is compensated by the growth of $\\Psi$. So, as for $[3,1,0]$, cancelling the contamination at **leading order** is enough.\n\n## 2. Clean combinations, rank on the multiplicity spaces, and end to end\nThis repeats `Minimal-ingredients-310-EH.wb` Section 8 with the seven insertions. $k=K_X/S_{\\rm ref}$ and $s=S_X/S_{\\rm ref}$ use $S_{\\rm ref}=S_{T_{(4,2)}}$, which is nonzero on every HW state.\n- **(a) Structural test:** the spread of $k,s$ over three twist-direction pairs at $\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$.\n- **(b) Clean space per sector:** the null space of the copies' $k$'s, with tolerance $10^{-3}$. Then the rank of the clean covectors restricted to $\\mathrm{HW}_\\mu$ over five $w$, at $\\varepsilon=10^{-4},10^{-5}$.\n- **(c) End to end:** the Q-side numbers only, $q_X=(X^B-W_X\\cdot e_1e_1)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$. The eigenvalue $X^B$ is read from $X\\Psi$, which is computed by applying the $t$'s to $\\Psi$. Least squares then gives $P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ (direction and scale), compared with the truth.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "WcovsM[zv_, wv_] := WcovsM[zv, wv] = Wcovs[zv, wv];\nzOf[ε_, φv_] := N[Exp[ε φv], pr];\nKSn[μ_, copy_, ε_, φv_, ωv_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φv], wv = zOf[ε, ωv], Ψ, r},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"]; r = SK[Ψ, μ, WcovsM[zv, wv], zv, wv];\n   <|\"S\" -> r[[1]], \"K\" -> r[[2]], \"k\" -> r[[2]]/r[[1, 4]], \"s\" -> r[[1]]/r[[1, 4]], \"sc\" -> Norm[Ψ] Max[Norm /@ WcovsM[zv, wv]]|>];\ndirs = {{\"φ, ω\", φ, ω}, {\"φ', ω\", {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, ω}, {\"φ, ω'\", φ, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}}};\nωSet = {ω, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}, {-3/5, 2/7, 1/3}, {5/6, 1/2, -1/8}, {2/9, -7/10, 3/4}};\n(* (a) structural test *)\n{tA, structT} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{r = Table[KSn[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-5, dd[[2]], dd[[3]]], {dd, dirs}]},\n     {μc[[1]], μc[[2]], N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Join[r[[i]][\"k\"] - r[[1]][\"k\"], r[[i]][\"s\"] - r[[1]][\"s\"]]]], {i, 3}]], 2]}], {μc, nonTop}]];\n(* (b) clean spaces (fitted at εfit, φ, ω) and HW rank *)\ncleanSpace[μ_] := cleanSpace[μ] = Module[{rows = Table[KSn[μ, c, εfit, φ, ω][\"k\"], {c, Length[hwB[μ]]}], sv, r, V},\n   sv = SingularValueList[rows, Tolerance -> 0]; r = Count[sv, x_ /; x > 10^-3 Max[sv]];\n   V = SingularValueDecomposition[rows][[3]]; Transpose[V][[r + 1 ;;]]];\nhwRank[μ_, vs_, ε_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φ], m}, m = Flatten[Table[With[{W = WcovsM[zv, zOf[ε, ωv]]}, Table[hwB[μ] . (v . W), {v, vs}]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1];\n   N[SingularValueList[m, Tolerance -> 0]/Norm[m], 3]];\n{tB, secTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{cs = cleanSpace[μ], mult = Length[hwB[μ]]}, {μ, mult, Length[cs], Take[hwRank[μ, cs, 10^-4], UpTo[mult + 1]], Take[hwRank[μ, cs, 10^-5], UpTo[mult + 1]]}], {μ, Rest[hwSecs]}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"(a) μ\", \"copy\", \"spread of k, s over directions (ε = 10^-5)\", \"\", \"\"}}, Append[#, \"\"] & /@ (Append[#, \"\"] & /@ structT),\n   {{\"(b) μ\", \"mult\", \"dim clean space\", \"HW-restricted rel. sv, ε=10^-4\", \"ε=10^-5\"}}, secTab, {{\"time (s)\", tA, tB, \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
