  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* diagnostics: (i) rank on HW_[6,4,2] and HW_[5,4,3] of ALL insertions (no cleaning) over five w; (ii) does the direction spread shrink with ε? *)\nunitVs = IdentityMatrix[7];\n{tC, diag} = AbsoluteTiming[{\n    {\"HW_[6,4,2], all 7 insertions, ε = 10^-4 | 10^-5\", hwRank[{6, 4, 2}, unitVs, 10^-4], hwRank[{6, 4, 2}, unitVs, 10^-5]},\n    {\"HW_[5,4,3], all 7 insertions\", hwRank[{5, 4, 3}, unitVs, 10^-4], hwRank[{5, 4, 3}, unitVs, 10^-5]},\n    {\"direction spread at ε = 10^-6 (max over states)\", Max[Table[With[{r = Table[KSn[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-6, dd[[2]], dd[[3]]], {dd, dirs}]}, N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Join[r[[i]][\"k\"] - r[[1]][\"k\"], r[[i]][\"s\"] - r[[1]][\"s\"]]]], {i, 3}]], 2]], {μc, nonTop}]], \"(at 10^-5: \" <> ToString[Max[structT[[All, 3]]]] <> \")\"}}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"diagnostic\", \"\", \"\"}}, diag, {{\"time (s)\", tC, \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
