n class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-5: 0.0014)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[548]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{diagnostic} &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{HW\\_[6,4,2], all 7 insertions, $\\varepsilon$ = 10\\^{}-4 | 10\\^{}-5} & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.112,0.00744\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.112,0.00745\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{HW\\_[5,4,3], all 7 insertions} & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.117\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.117\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{direction spread at $\\varepsilon$ = 10\\^{}-6 (max over states)} & 0.00014 & \\text{(at 10\\^{}-5: 0.0014)}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 1.155173 & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "32f3a147-b710-42c7-98f6-dcab02fc9e3f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Diagnostics (cell above).**\n- **Raw insertions see all of $\\mathrm{HW}_{[6,4,2]}$.** Over five $w$, the seven raw insertions have rank 3 on it (relative singular values $1,\\ 0.11,\\ 0.0074$, stable in $\\varepsilon$). Cleaning on all three copies at once removes one direction: the three copies' $k$'s span only 2 dimensions, and the 5-dimensional common clean space reaches only rank 2.\n- **The contamination is structural.** The direction spread falls from $1.4\\times10^{-3}$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$ to $1.4\\times10^{-4}$ at $10^{-6}$, i.e. $O(\\varepsilon)$ with a large coefficient.\n\n### 2c. End to end, with sector-wide and per-copy clean spaces\n- **Sector-wide:** combinations clean on every copy of the weight, as for $[3,1,0]$.\n- **Per copy:** the 6-dimensional null space of that copy's own $k$. The copies of a weight are told apart by their transfer eigenvalues, which are Q-side data. The coefficients are then copy-specific, which is just as much a fit as the sector-wide ones until closed forms are found.\n\nThe data are the Q-side numbers $q_X=(X^B-W_X\\cdot e_1e_1)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$, with $X^B$ from $X\\Psi$, at five $w$. The table gives the relative error of the recovered $P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ (scale included) and the angle error.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* XΨ for the seven insertions, by applying t's to the vector (eigenvalue X^B = (XΨ)_k/Ψ_k) *)\ntApplyR[vv_, a_, x_, zv_] := Which[a == 0, vv, a == 3, (Times @@ zv) nu[1][x] nu[2][x - hN] nu[3][x - 2 hN] vv, True, tL2[a, x, zv] . vv];\nvecT[λ_, x_, zv_, v0_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0 v0, Signature[σ] Fold[tApplyR[#1, #2[[1]], #2[[2]], zv] &, v0, Reverse[Table[{as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN}, {i, n}]]]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\neigVals[Ψ_, zv_] := Module[{u1 = thN[[1]] - 4 hN, u2 = thN[[2]], k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]], T22v, xs},\n   T22v = vecT[{2, 2}, u2, zv, Ψ];\n   xs = Join[Table[vecT[λ, u1, zv, Ψ], {λ, {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}, {4, 2}}}], {tL2[2, u2 + hN, zv] . Ψ, T22v, tL2[1, u2 - 2 hN, zv] . T22v}];\n   (#[[k]]/Ψ[[k]]) & /@ xs];\nqNums[Ψ_, zv_, wv_, ev_] := With[{W = WcovsM[zv, wv], om = Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ}, Table[(ev[[j]] - W[[j]] . e11) om, {j, 7}]];\ncleanOne[μ_, copy_] := cleanOne[μ, copy] = Module[{k = KSn[μ, copy, εfit, φ, ω][\"k\"]}, NullSpace[{k/Norm[k]}, Tolerance -> 10^-6]];\n(* least-squares HW part from Q-side numbers; returns {rel. error, angle error, correct digits of the rel. error} *)\nreconHW[μ_, copy_, ε_, vs_, φv_ : φ] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε, φv], Ψ, ev, M, y, a, tru, re},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"]; ev = eigVals[Ψ, zv];\n   {M, y} = Transpose[Flatten[Table[With[{wv = zOf[ε, ωv]}, With[{W = WcovsM[zv, wv], q = qNums[Ψ, zv, wv, ev]}, Table[{hwB[μ] . (v . W), v . q}, {v, vs}]]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1]];\n   a = LeastSquares[M, y]; tru = hwB[μ] . Ψ; re = Norm[a - tru]/Norm[tru];\n   {N[re, 3], N[Sqrt[Max[0, 1 - Abs[Conjugate[a] . tru]^2/(Norm[a]^2 Norm[tru]^2)]], 3], Round[Precision[re]]}];\n(* eigenvalue check: XΨ = X^B Ψ *)\neigRes = With[{zv = zOf[10^-4, φ]}, With[{Ψ = pickState[{5, 4, 3}, 1, zv][\"psi\"]}, With[{ev = eigVals[Ψ, zv], T22v = vecT[{2, 2}, thN[[2]], zv, Ψ]}, N[Norm[T22v - ev[[6]] Ψ]/Norm[T22v], 3]]]];\n{tE, recTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{cs = cleanSpace[μc[[1]]], c1 = cleanOne[μc[[1]], μc[[2]]]},\n     Join[{μc[[1]], μc[[2]], Length[hwB[μc[[1]]]]}, reconHW[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-4, cs], reconHW[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-4, c1]]], {μc, nonTop}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"mult\", \"sector-clean: rel. err (ε=10^-4)\", \"angle err\", \"digits\", \"per-copy clean: rel. err (ε=10^-4)\", \"angle err\", \"digits\"}}, recTab,\n   {{\"eigenvalue residual (T22(θ2) on [5,4,3]_1)\", eigRes, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", tE, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
