 style=\"top:-15.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-21.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-22.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-24.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-25.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-26.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
