  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Results of Section 3 (2026-10-02, P1, 250 digits)\nWith **site 1 + $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ only**, all 18 non-top HW states of $[4,2,0]^2$ are recovered, scale included, in the fair test ($\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$, $\\varphi'$). Errors are $10^{-4.6}$–$10^{-7.1}$, with $\\ge118$ correct digits.\n- **Sector-wide cleaning suffices** for all multiplicity-1 sectors (including $[4,4,4]$), $[7,4,1]$ (rank 2, second singular value 0.04) and **$[5,4,3]$** (rank 2, 0.13).\n- **Per-copy cleaning is needed** for $[7,3,2]$ and $[6,5,1]$, whose sector-wide rank drops to 1 without site 2, and for $[6,4,2]$, which needs it even with site 2.\n- **So site 2 is not essential.** It only reduces the number of sectors that need copy-specific coefficients, from three to one.\n- **Caveat.** The tolerance issue fixed in `Minimal-ingredients-310-EH.wb` Section 9 (an already-clean insertion has $k=O(\\varepsilon)$) did not bite here: every end-to-end error is small.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. The site-1 eigenvalues at $\\theta_1-4h$ in terms of dual Q's\nThis is the test of `Minimal-ingredients-310-EH.wb` Section 10, here with $\\Lambda=[4,2,0]$. Predictions:\n- **Parallelism:** $v(\\theta_1)\\parallel v(\\theta_1-h)\\parallel v(\\theta_1-2h)$, since $\\Lambda_2=2$.\n- **2-plane:** $v(\\theta_1-5h),\\dots,v(\\theta_1)$ lie in one 2-plane.\n- **Eigenvalues:**\n$$T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-4h)=P_\\lambda\\,\\frac{\\det_2[v(\\theta_1+(\\lambda_1-4)h),\\,v(\\theta_1+(\\lambda_2-5)h)]}{\\det_2[v(\\theta_1-4h),\\,v(\\theta_1-5h)]},\\qquad\\lambda_1\\le4,\\ \\lambda_3=0.$$\n\nThe test uses the finite test twist and every state of the sectors $(5,4,3)$, $(4,4,4)$ and $(7,3,2)$. Each eigenvalue is computed by acting with $T_\\lambda$ on $\\Psi$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "zF = N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr];\ntApplyR[vv_, a_, x_, zv_] := Which[a == 0, vv, a == 3, (Times @@ zv) nu[1][x] nu[2][x - hN] nu[3][x - 2 hN] vv, True, tL2[a, x, zv] . vv];\nvecT[λ_, x_, zv_, v0_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]},\n     If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0 v0, Signature[σ] Fold[tApplyR[#1, #2[[1]], #2[[2]], zv] &, v0, Reverse[Table[{as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hN}, {i, n}]]]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\ntEvPoly[Ψ_, zv_, a_] := Module[{k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]], xs = Range[2 a + 1]/7}, InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{xs, Table[(tL2[a, x, zv] . Ψ)[[k]]/Ψ[[k]], {x, xs}]}], X]];\nt3Ev[zv_, x_] := (Times @@ zv) nu[1][x] nu[2][x - hN] nu[3][x - 2 hN];\ndualQ[zj_, d_, t1_, t2_, zv_] := Module[{c, q, eq, cl, sol},\n   q[x_] := x^d + Sum[c[i] x^i, {i, 0, d - 1}];\n   eq = Expand[nu[3][X] nu[3][X - hN] nu[3][X - 2 hN] zj q[X + hN] - t1 nu[3][X - hN] nu[3][X - 2 hN] q[X] + t2 nu[3][X - 2 hN] q[X - hN]/zj - t3Ev[zv, X] q[X - 2 hN]/zj^2];\n   cl = CoefficientList[eq, X];\n   sol = If[d == 0, {}, LeastSquares[Table[Coefficient[e, c[i]], {e, cl}, {i, 0, d - 1}], -(cl /. c[_] -> 0)]];\n   {Function[x, Evaluate[x^d + Sum[If[d == 0, 0, sol[[i + 1]]] x^i, {i, 0, d - 1}]]], Max[Abs[cl /. Thread[Table[c[i], {i, 0, d - 1}] -> sol]]]/Max[Abs[cl /. c[_] -> 0]]}];\nvQ[Ψ_, μ_, zv_] := Module[{t1 = tEvPoly[Ψ, zv, 1], t2 = tEvPoly[Ψ, zv, 2], qs}, qs = Table[dualQ[zv[[j]], μ[[j]], t1, t2, zv], {j, 3}];\n   {Function[u, Evaluate[Table[zv[[j]]^(u/hN) qs[[j, 1]][u], {j, 3}]]], Max[qs[[All, 2]]]}];\ndet2[a_, b_, rows_] := a[[rows[[1]]]] b[[rows[[2]]]] - a[[rows[[2]]]] b[[rows[[1]]]];\nuLoc = thN[[1]] - 4 hN; Λ1 = Λ[[1]]; Λ2 = Λ[[2]];\nPlam[λ_] := Product[nu[3][uLoc + (c - r) hN], {r, Length[λ]}, {c, λ[[r]]}];\nshapesT = {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}, {4, 2}, {2, 1}, {4, 1}, {3}, {3, 3}};\ntestSecs = {{5, 4, 3}, {4, 4, 4}, {7, 3, 2}};\n{t4, tests4} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[Module[{sts = Select[statesAt[zF], #[\"mu\"] === μ &]}, Table[Module[{Ψ = st[\"psi\"], vv, res, v, th = thN[[1]], k, form, ev},\n       {vv, res} = vQ[Ψ, μ, zF]; v[n_] := vv[th - n hN]; k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]];\n       form[λ_, rows_] := Plam[λ] det2[v[Λ1 - λ[[1]]], v[Λ1 + 1 - If[Length[λ] > 1, λ[[2]], 0]], rows]/det2[v[Λ1], v[Λ1 + 1], rows];\n       ev[λ_] := (vecT[λ, uLoc, zF, Ψ])[[k]]/Ψ[[k]];\n       {μ, res,\n        Max[Table[Abs[det2[v[0], v[n], {1, 2}]]/(Norm[v[0]] Norm[v[n]]), {n, 1, Λ2}]],\n        Max[Table[Abs[Det[{v[n], v[n + 1], v[n + 2]}]]/(Norm[v[n]] Norm[v[n + 1]] Norm[v[n + 2]]), {n, Λ2, Λ1 - 1}]],\n        Abs[Det[{v[Λ1], v[Λ1 + 1], v[Λ1 + 2]}]]/(Norm[v[Λ1]] Norm[v[Λ1 + 1]] Norm[v[Λ1 + 2]]),\n        Max[Table[Abs[form[λ, rows] - ev[λ]]/Max[Abs[ev[λ]], 10^-30], {λ, shapesT}, {rows, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}, {1, 3}}}]]}], {st, sts}]], {μ, testSecs}], 1]];\nsum4 = Table[With[{r = Select[tests4, #[[1]] === μ &]}, {μ, Length[r], N[Max[r[[All, 2]]], 3], N[Max[r[[All, 3]]], 3], N[Max[r[[All, 4]]], 3], N[Min[r[[All, 5]]], 3], N[Max[r[[All, 6]]], 3]}], {μ, testSecs}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"# states\", \"dual Baxter residual\", \"parallel v(θ1)∥v(θ1-h)∥v(θ1-2h) (max rel.)\", \"2-plane det3's (max rel.)\", \"denominator det3 (min rel., ≠ 0)\", \"formula vs eigenvalue (max rel., 8 shapes × 3 row pairs)\"}}, sum4, {{\"time (s)\", t4, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
