"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">formula vs eigenvalue (max rel., 8 shapes </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 3 row pairs)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">196</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">194</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">199</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[789]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{\\# states} & \\text{dual Baxter residual} & \\text{parallel v($\\theta$1)$\\|$v($\\theta$1-h)$\\|$v($\\theta$1-2h) (max rel.)} & \\text{2-plane det3's (max rel.)} & \\text{denominator det3 (min rel., $\\not=$ 0)} & \\text{formula vs eigenvalue (max rel., 8 shapes $\\times$ 3 row pairs)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,4,3\\right\\} & 36 & 0.\\times 10^{-229} & 0.\\times 10^{-228} & 1.56\\times 10^{-241} & 1.82\\times 10^{-16} & 0.\\times 10^{-196}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,4,4\\right\\} & 45 & 0.\\times 10^{-227} & 0.\\times 10^{-225} & 3.70\\times 10^{-237} & 3.69\\times 10^{-16} & 0.\\times 10^{-194}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{7,3,2\\right\\} & 10 & 0.\\times 10^{-231} & 0.\\times 10^{-234} & 4.67\\times 10^{-244} & 2.67\\times 10^{-19} & 0.\\times 10^{-199}\\\\\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 82.754315 &  &  &  &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "40bd5220-cb14-4b11-9940-47d43123a63a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Result of Section 4 (2026-10-02, P1, finite test twist, 250 digits)\nAll 91 states of the sectors $(5,4,3)$, $(4,4,4)$ and $(7,3,2)$ were tested.\n- **Dual Q's** with $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j$: the residual is exactly 0 to $\\ge225$ digits.\n- **Parallelism** $v(\\theta_1)\\parallel v(\\theta_1-h)\\parallel v(\\theta_1-2h)$: exact to $\\ge225$ digits.\n- **2-plane:** to $10^{-236}$. The denominator $\\det_3$ is nonzero.\n- **The formula** matches the eigenvalue to $\\ge194$ digits for (1,1), (2,2), (3,2), (4,2), (2,1), (4,1), (3), (3,3), and every row pair. $T_{(3,3)}(\\theta_1-4h)=0$ comes out of it automatically, since both of its arguments are parallel.\n\n**Explicit form for the four localizing shapes.** Write $D_{ab}=\\det_2[v(\\theta_1-ah),v(\\theta_1-bh)]$ (any fixed row pair), $\\rho_k=Q^j(\\theta_1-kh)/Q^j(\\theta_1-2h)$ (the same for every $j$), $\\theta_{12}=\\theta_1-\\theta_2$, and $P_\\lambda=\\prod_{(r,c)\\in\\lambda}(c-r-4)h\\,(\\theta_{12}+(c-r-4)h)$. Then:\n- $T_{(1,1)}(\\theta_1-4h)=20h^2(\\theta_{12}-4h)(\\theta_{12}-5h)\\;D_{34}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(2,2)}(\\theta_1-4h)=240h^4(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)^2(\\theta_{12}-5h)\\;D_{23}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(3,2)}(\\theta_1-4h)=-480h^5(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)^2(\\theta_{12}-5h)\\;\\rho_1D_{23}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(4,2)}(\\theta_1-4h)=480h^6(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)^2(\\theta_{12}-5h)\\;\\rho_0D_{23}/D_{45}$.\n\n**Divided by the localization prefactors $f_\\lambda$** (`L2-420-localization.md`), with $\\kappa=240h^4\\frac{(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)}{(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h)}$:\n- $T_{(1,1)}/f_{(1,1)}=20h^2\\frac{\\theta_{12}-4h}{\\theta_{12}-2h}\\,D_{34}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(2,2)}/f_{(2,2)}=\\kappa\\,D_{23}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(3,2)}/f_{(3,2)}=-2h\\,\\kappa\\,\\rho_1D_{23}/D_{45}$;\n- $T_{(4,2)}/f_{(4,2)}=2h^2\\kappa\\,\\rho_0D_{23}/D_{45}$.\n\nEverything uses only the dual Q's at the six site-1 points $\\theta_1-5h,\\dots,\\theta_1$. A site-1 combination $a_0\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle+\\sum_\\lambda c_\\lambda T_\\lambda\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle/f_\\lambda$ is therefore\n$$\\frac{\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle}{D_{45}}\\Big[a_0D_{45}+20h^2\\tfrac{\\theta_{12}-4h}{\\theta_{12}-2h}\\,c_{11}D_{34}+\\kappa\\,D_{23}\\big(c_{22}-2h\\,c_{32}\\rho_1+2h^2c_{42}\\rho_0\\big)\\Big],$$\nwith $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ the $6\\times6$ determinant. The parallelism rests on a guessed dual-QQ factor $\\prod_{n=1}^{\\Lambda_2}(u-\\theta_s+nh)$; it was checked numerically, not derived.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. From 2×2 determinants to single Q's\n**Dual QQ relation (to be tested).**\n$$z_b\\,q^a(u)q^b(u+h)-z_a\\,q^b(u)q^a(u+h)=(z_b-z_a)\\,G(u)\\,q_c(u+sh),\\qquad G(u)=\\prod_s\\prod_{n=1}^{\\Lambda_2}(u-\\theta_s+nh).$$\nHere $q_c$ is the **direct** monic polynomial ($Q_c=z_c^{-u/h}q_c$, $\\deg q_c=2\\Lambda_1-\\mu_c$). The degrees match for any shift $s$; the cell tests $s=-1,0,1$. Consistency with the direct QQ relation suggests $s=1$.\n\n**Consequence for $s=1$.** Each consecutive $D_{k,k+1}$ is a single $Q_c$, so, for any $c$ and any $j$:\n- $T_{(1,1)}/f_{(1,1)}=10h^2\\chi_3\\,Q_c(\\theta_1-3h)/Q_c(\\theta_1-4h)$;\n- $T_{(2,2)}/f_{(2,2)}=40h^4\\chi_3^2\\,Q_c(\\theta_1-2h)/Q_c(\\theta_1-4h)$;\n- $T_{(3,2)}/f_{(3,2)}=-80h^5\\chi_3^2\\,\\frac{Q^j(\\theta_1-h)}{Q^j(\\theta_1-2h)}\\,\\frac{Q_c(\\theta_1-2h)}{Q_c(\\theta_1-4h)}$;\n- $T_{(4,2)}/f_{(4,2)}=80h^6\\chi_3^2\\,\\frac{Q^j(\\theta_1)}{Q^j(\\theta_1-2h)}\\,\\frac{Q_c(\\theta_1-2h)}{Q_c(\\theta_1-4h)}$.\n\nAll $\\theta_{12}$-dependence cancels against $f_\\lambda$. The ratios do not depend on $c$ because the direct vectors $(Q_1,Q_2,Q_3)$ at $\\theta_1-4h$, $\\theta_1-3h$ and $\\theta_1-2h$ are parallel; that is tested too.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* direct Baxter: ν1(x)ν1(x+h)ν1(x+2h)Q(x-h) - t1(x)ν1(x+h)ν1(x+2h)Q(x) + t2(x+h)ν1(x+2h)Q(x+h) - t3(x+2h)Q(x+2h) = 0, Q = z^{-x/h} q *)\ndirQ[zj_, d_, t1_, t2_, zv_] := Module[{c, q, eq, cl, sol},\n   q[x_] := x^d + Sum[c[i] x^i, {i, 0, d - 1}];\n   eq = Expand[nu[1][X] nu[1][X + hN] nu[1][X + 2 hN] zj q[X - hN] - t1 nu[1][X + hN] nu[1][X + 2 hN] q[X] + (t2 /. X -> X + hN) nu[1][X + 2 hN] q[X + hN]/zj - t3Ev[zv, X + 2 hN] q[X + 2 hN]/zj^2];\n   cl = CoefficientList[eq, X];\n   sol = If[d == 0, {}, LeastSquares[Table[Coefficient[e, c[i]], {e, cl}, {i, 0, d - 1}], -(cl /. c[_] -> 0)]];\n   {Function[x, Evaluate[x^d + Sum[If[d == 0, 0, sol[[i + 1]]] x^i, {i, 0, d - 1}]]], Max[Abs[cl /. Thread[Table[c[i], {i, 0, d - 1}] -> sol]]]/Max[Abs[cl /. c[_] -> 0]]}];\nqsBoth[Ψ_, μ_, zv_] := Module[{t1 = tEvPoly[Ψ, zv, 1], t2 = tEvPoly[Ψ, zv, 2]}, {Table[dualQ[zv[[j]], μ[[j]], t1, t2, zv], {j, 3}], Table[dirQ[zv[[i]], 2 Λ1 - μ[[i]], t1, t2, zv], {i, 3}]}];\nGfun[u_] := Product[u - thN[[s]] + n hN, {s, 2}, {n, 1, Λ2}];\n(* dual QQ residual for shift sh, over the three (a,b,c) *)\nqqRes[up_, lo_, zv_, sh_] := Max[Table[With[{a = abc[[1]], b = abc[[2]], c = abc[[3]]}, With[{lhs = Expand[zv[[b]] up[[a, 1]][X] up[[b, 1]][X + hN] - zv[[a]] up[[b, 1]][X] up[[a, 1]][X + hN]]},\n      Max[Abs[CoefficientList[lhs - Expand[(zv[[b]] - zv[[a]]) Gfun[X] lo[[c, 1]][X + sh hN]], X]]]/Max[Abs[CoefficientList[lhs, X]]]]], {abc, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {3, 1, 2}}}]];\ntt12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\nfLoc = <|{1, 1} -> (tt12 - 2 hN) (tt12 - 5 hN), {2, 2} -> (tt12 - hN) (tt12 - 2 hN) (tt12 - 4 hN) (tt12 - 5 hN), {3, 2} -> (tt12 - hN) (tt12 - 2 hN)^2 (tt12 - 4 hN) (tt12 - 5 hN), {4, 2} -> (tt12 - hN)^2 (tt12 - 2 hN)^2 (tt12 - 4 hN) (tt12 - 5 hN)|>;\n{t5, tests5} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[Module[{sts = Select[statesAt[zF], #[\"mu\"] === μ &], χ3 = Times @@ zF, th = thN[[1]]}, Table[Module[{Ψ = st[\"psi\"], up, lo, Qd, Qu, k, ev, pred, uvec},\n       {up, lo} = qsBoth[Ψ, μ, zF]; k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]];\n       Qd[j_][u_] := zF[[j]]^(u/hN) up[[j, 1]][u]; Qu[c_][u_] := zF[[c]]^(-u/hN) lo[[c, 1]][u];\n       uvec[u_] := Table[Qu[c][u], {c, 3}];\n       ev[λ_] := (vecT[λ, uLoc, zF, Ψ])[[k]]/Ψ[[k]]/fLoc[λ];\n       pred[{1, 1}, c_, j_] := 10 hN^2 χ3 Qu[c][th - 3 hN]/Qu[c][th - 4 hN];\n       pred[{2, 2}, c_, j_] := 40 hN^4 χ3^2 Qu[c][th - 2 hN]/Qu[c][th - 4 hN];\n       pred[{3, 2}, c_, j_] := -80 hN^5 χ3^2 Qd[j][th - hN]/Qd[j][th - 2 hN] Qu[c][th - 2 hN]/Qu[c][th - 4 hN];\n       pred[{4, 2}, c_, j_] := 80 hN^6 χ3^2 Qd[j][th]/Qd[j][th - 2 hN] Qu[c][th - 2 hN]/Qu[c][th - 4 hN];\n       {μ, Max[up[[All, 2]]], Max[lo[[All, 2]]], qqRes[up, lo, zF, -1], qqRes[up, lo, zF, 0], qqRes[up, lo, zF, 1],\n        Max[Table[Norm[uvec[th - n hN] - (uvec[th - n hN] . uvec[th - 4 hN]/(uvec[th - 4 hN] . uvec[th - 4 hN])) uvec[th - 4 hN]]/Norm[uvec[th - n hN]], {n, {2, 3}}]],\n        Max[Table[Abs[pred[λ, c, j] - ev[λ]]/Abs[ev[λ]], {λ, Keys[fLoc]}, {c, 3}, {j, 3}]]}], {st, sts}]], {μ, testSecs}], 1]];\nshow[x_] := If[TrueQ[x == 0], \"0 (\" <> ToString[Round[Accuracy[x]]] <> \" digits)\", ScientificForm[N[x, 3], 3]];\nsum5 = Table[With[{r = Select[tests5, #[[1]] === μ &]}, Join[{μ, Length[r]}, show /@ Table[Max[r[[All, i]]], {i, 2, 8}]]], {μ, testSecs}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"# states\", \"dual Baxter\", \"direct Baxter\", \"dual QQ, s = -1\", \"s = 0\", \"s = 1\", \"direct parallel at θ1-4h, -3h, -2h\", \"single-Q formulas vs T_λ/f_λ (4 shapes, all c, j)\"}}, sum5, {{\"time (s)\", t5, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"73\" data-out-n=\"799\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"28\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[799]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose deli